QuestGuidance.Register("en",331,{
[10561]="70017924\n1\tMeet Dardúr for further Rune-keeper training\tDardúr is at Gondamon in Ered Luin. You have been told to seek the wisdom of the rune-keeper Dardúr.\n2\tTalk to Dardúr at Gondamon\tDardúr is at Gondamon in Ered Luin. You have been told to seek the wisdom of the rune-keeper Dardúr.\n",
[10562]="700174ED\n1\tTalk to Márus at the Foundations of Stone\tMárus can be found somewhere within the Foundations of Stone in Moria. You have been instructed to seek guidance from the Rune-keeper Márus.\n2\tTalk to Márus at the Foundations of Stone\tMárus can be found somewhere within the Foundations of Stone in Moria. You have been instructed to seek guidance from the Rune-keeper Márus.\n",
[10563]="70002EF9\n1\tDwarves can be found all over Othrikar. Surely one of them can translate the Elvish mining records.\t\n2\tBring the records to Regin\tRegin is at Othrikar in the North Downs. The old records have been translated, but apparently a map is required before the directions will make sense. You should return to Regin with the deciphered records.\n",
[10564]="7005AB0E\n1\tClean warding runes (total: 6)\tKyrstig believes the Angmarim may have tampered with some of the ward-runes around the Thing-fold. You should repair the warding runes around Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.\n2\tTalk to Kyrstig\tKyrstig can be found near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold. You should talk to Kyrstig.\n",
[10565]="700192FE\n1\tDefeat Orc-scouts (total: 6)\tThe Orc-scouts can be found running to and fro throughout eastern Fanuidhol, to the north of Talan Fanuidhol. The scouts that have accompanied the expeditionary force of Moria Orcs into Fanuidhol are quick and clever. They ensure that the Orc-leaders are well-informed, enabling them to make deadly decisions. Maenhador has asked you to put an end to them.\n2\tTalk to Maenhador at Talan Fanuidhol\tMaenhador is at Talan Fanuidhol, south of Fanuidhol. You should return to Maenhador with news of your success.\n",
[10566]="7002FD3E\n1\tDefeat goblin riders outside Krash-bálum (total: 6)\tGoblin riders can be found circling the half-orc camp, Krash-bálum, to the north-east of Garsfeld. Gísling asked you to hunt down the goblin riders which have been raiding the crofts.\n2\tTalk to Gísling at the Mead Hall of Garsfeld\tGísling can be found inside the Mead Hall of Garsfeld, south-west of Krash-bálum. You should return to Gísling with news of your victory.\n",
[10567]="70034AA4\n1\tSearch for any sign of the Byre Tor refugees in the Balewood\tThe refugees and their belongings can likely be found in southern Balewood off the eastern side of the Orc-roadway. Cerdic has asked that you venture into the Balewood now that the Warg-riders have passed. He hopes you will find some sign of the Byre Tor refugees that fled into the frozen forest.\n2\tExamine the rucksack\tThe rucksack can be found off the eastern side of the Orc-roadway in Balewood. You have discovered a rucksack belonging to what must be a refugee of Byre Tor, but the owner is nowhere to be found.\n3\tExamine the rucksack\tThe rucksack can be found off the eastern side of the Orc-roadway in Balewood. The light snowfall on the rucksack leads you to believe that the refugee must still be nearby. You should prepare yourself before travelling deeper into the Balewood.\n4\tTalk to Húna in the hidden cave\tYou have rescued several refugees of Byre Tor, and they now take shelter in a nearby cave in the Balewood. You should speak to Húna and see if you can aid them further.\n",
[10568]="700571EB\n1\tTalk to Skarding Wargsbane at Thokvist\tSkarding can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Skarding.\n2\tTalk to Fanglind at Thokvist\tFanglind can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Fanglind.\n",
[10569]="7000789E\n1\tTalk to Rurik Fennel in Combe\tRurik Fennel, a local locksmith, lives on the road that runs south past The Comb and Wattle Inn in Combe. Constable Sageford wants you to confront Rurik Fennel of the coincidences surrounding the Blackwold brigands and his name and initials appearing on their crates and letters they carry.\n2\tTalk to Constable Sageford in Combe\tConstable Sageford awaits news of Rurik's involvement near the centre of Combe. Rurik Fennel appears to have been an unwitting and bullied pawn of the Blackwold.\n",
[10570]="7004E1E5\n1\tSearch the path into the Grey Mountains for signs of Karazgar\tKarazgar passed near to Ravenhill when he departed the lands of the North. King Thorin III has asked you to search the lands surrounding Ravenhill for signs of Karazgar's passage into the Grey Mountains.\n2\tFollow the trail of rust towards the Grey Mountains\tThe trail of rust can be found to the south-west of Ravenhill. You have discovered a trail of rust leading north-west towards the Grey Mountains and should follow to see where it leads.\n3\tSignal the raven to return to Ravenhill\tThe lone raven can be found near the path into the Grey Mountains. You followed a trail of rust and discovered another of Arcah's ravens. You should signal it to return to its kin at Ravenhill.\n4\tTalk to Arcah\tArcah can be found at Ravenhill. The raven you found may know where Vethúg and Karazgar have gone in the wake of the attack on Erebor. You should talk to Arcah and learn what it saw.\n5\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have learned that Karazgar passed into the Grey Mountains in pursuit of Vethúg Wintermind. You should inform King Thorin of what you learned.\n",
[10571]="700164E2\n1\tCollect acid-glands (total: 6)\tGlow-worms can be found to the north-west, in the Water-works. Ansurr asked you to gather acid glands from glow-worms. With them, he can fashion an oil to restore the water-wheels.\n2\tTalk to Ansurr in Hulwul-nefekh\030Collect Acid-gland (total: 6)\tAnsurr is in Hulwul-nefekh, in central Water-works. Ansurr will be pleased to see you have gathered all of the acid-glands he needs to create his oil.\n",
[10572]="70058FDD\n1\tCollect Orkish orders in the trenches around Zudramdân (total: 6)\030Collect a missive from a Gundabad trench-commander\tGundabad trench-commanders and Orkish orders can be found in the trenches around Zudramdân in the War of Three Peaks. In addition to seeking to intercept a missive from Gorgar the Ruthless, Agnar Brokentooth has also asked you to collect Orkish orders from the forces of Gundabad.\n2\tDeliver the missive and Orkish orders to Agnar Brokentooth\tAgnar Brokentooth can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh. You have collected many Orkish orders and also recovered a missive from Gorgar the Ruthless. You should deliver them to Agnar Brokentooth.\n",
[10573]="70053E77\n1\tDefeat wargs and warg-masters in Râkh Mathán\tWargs and warg-masters can be found in Râkh Mathán in Rath Dúath. You should defeat wargs and warg-masters in Râkh Mathán.\n2\tDefeat wargs (total: 15)\030Defeat Rukhuk\tWargs and warg-masters can be found in Râkh Mathán in Rath Dúath. You should defeat wargs and warg-masters in Râkh Mathán.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeat many wargs and warg-masters in Râkh Mathán.\n",
[10574]="70053E6B\n1\tDestroy corrupt runes in Râkh Mathán\tCorrupt runes can be found in Râkh Mathán in Rath Dúath. You should destroy corrupt runes in Râkh Mathán.\n2\tDestroy corrupt runes (total: 12)\tCorrupt runes can be found in Râkh Mathán in Rath Dúath. You should destroy corrupt runes in Râkh Mathán.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed many corrupt runes in Râkh Mathán.\n",
[10575]="70053E76\n1\tBurn spider corpses and mounds of hides in Râkh Mathán\tMounds of hides and corpses of spiders can be found in Râkh Mathán in Rath Dúath. You should burn spider corpses and mounds of hides in Râkh Mathán.\n2\tBurn spider corpses (total: 10)\030Burn mounds of hides (total: 8)\tSpider corpses and mounds of hides can be found in Râkh Mathán in Rath Dúath. You should burn spider corpses and mounds of hides in Râkh Mathán.\n3\tCompleted\tBurned spider corpses and mounds of hides in Râkh Mathán.\n",
[10576]="7004463E\n1\tFind the valve chain\030Find the valve gear\030Find the valve rod\tThe missing parts of the main cistern valve can be found within the cisterns. You should find and collect these parts for Rathon.\n2\tSpeak with Rathon\tRathon can be found outside the cistern entrance on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should speak with Rathon.\n3\tRepair the main drainage valve\tThe main drainage valve can be found outside the cisterns on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should repair the main drainage valve for Rathon.\n4\tSpeak with Rathon\tRathon can be found outside the cistern entrance on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should speak with Rathon.\n",
[10577]="7006EB87\n1\tSpeak with Mizâdi when you are ready to go\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh when you are ready.\n2\tSpeak with Razâl near the tower in Kûr Anzar\tSpeak with Razâl near the tower in Kûr Anzar.\n",
[10578]="7005B1F5\n1\tDestroy blacksmithing tools at Gazat-fark and Durbángh\tDestroying blacksmithing tools at Gazat-fark and Durbángh would briefly halt the progress of arming Gorgar's forces. Gazat-fark and Durbángh sit at the bottom level of Deepscrave.\n2\tDestroying blacksmithing tools at Gazat-fark and Durbángh would briefly halt the progress of arming Gorgar's forces. Gazat-fark and Durbángh sit at the bottom level of Deepscrave.\t\n3\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed the Orcs' blacksmithing tools.\n",
[10579]="7001BEA4\n1\tCollect crates of stolen belongings at Bolg Maufulug (total: 7)\030Defeat enemies in Bolg Maufulug (total: 6)\tBolg Maufulug lies to the west and a little north from Talan Fanuidhol. Bahanneth has asked you to enter Bolg Maufulug and defeat the Orcs there. He has also asked you to collect any stolen belongings you find as well.\n2\tBring the stolen belongings to Bahanneth at Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, east and a little south of Bolg Maufulug. You should return to Bahanneth with the stolen belongings you recovered and news of your victory against the Orcs.\n",
[10580]="7001BEA5\n1\tCollect crates of stolen belongings at Drûmaudhul (total: 7)\030Defeat goblins, Orcs, and Wargs in Drûmaudhul (total: 6)\tDrûmaudhul lies to the north-west from Talan Fanuidhol. Bahanneth has asked you to enter Drûmaudhul and defeat the Orcs there. He has also asked you to collect any stolen belongings you find as well.\n2\tBring the stolen belongings to Bahanneth at Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, south-east of Drûmaudhul. You should return to Bahanneth with the stolen belongings you recovered and news of your victory against the Orcs.\n",
[10581]="7001BEA6\n1\tCollect crates of stolen belongings at Mokûrz Gundul (total: 7)\030Defeat enemies in Mokûrz Gundul (total: 6)\tMokûrz Gundul lies to the north-west from Talan Fanuidhol. Bahanneth has asked you to enter Mokûrz Gundul and defeat the Orcs there. He has also asked you to collect any stolen belongings you find as well.\n2\tBring the stolen belongings to Bahanneth at Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, south-east of Mokûrz Gundul. You should return to Bahanneth with the stolen belongings you recovered and news of your victory against the Orcs.\n",
[10582]="7001BEA7\n1\tCollect crates of stolen belongings at Nardur-stazg (total: 7)\030Defeat enemies in Nardur-stazg (total: 6)\tNardur-stazg lies to the north-west from Talan Fanuidhol. Bahanneth has asked you to enter Nardur-stazg and defeat the Orcs there. He has also asked you to collect any stolen belongings you find as well.\n2\tBring the stolen belongings to Bahanneth at Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, east and a little south of Nardur-stazg. You should return to Bahanneth with the stolen belongings you recovered and news of your victory against the Orcs.\n",
[10583]="70020DA3\n1\tTalk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair\tThere are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair to the south-west of the shrine. You should ask one of the Rangers of the Grey Company about the ox-shrine you discovered.\n",
[10584]="7000D4F0\n1\tUse Altar\030Collect Broken Crossbow\030Collect Broken Sword\tAltars of the Angmarim can be found throughout Himbar, near the road or within the Angmarim-encampments. Areneth said that a display of strength could break the spirits of the Angarim loyal to Mordor. He asked you to place the captured weapons upon the altars of the Angmarim as a form of intimidation.\n2\tTalk to Areneth\tThe Rangers of Gath Forthnír wait for you at their camp to the east of Carn Dûm. You broke the morale of the Angmarim with your display of strength and resolve. It will be some time before their willingness to fight returns.\n",
[10585]="7005A99C\n1\tDestroy hobgoblin weapons and supplies at Sadauk-kala\tSadauk-kala can be found in western Máttugard. You should destroy hobgoblin weapons and supplies at Sadauk-kala.\n2\tDestroy hobgoblin supplies (total: 10)\030Destroy hobgoblin weapons (total: 10)\tSadauk-kala can be found in western Máttugard. You should destroy hobgoblin weapons and supplies at Sadauk-kala.\n",
[10586]="700451DD\n1\tTalk to the blacksmith\tFind the blacksmith in Ost Rimmon and see if he can provide Sithgar with shoes for Witherbreca.\n2\tGather abandoned tools (total: 6)\tDringrod doesn't have any horseshoes or iron to make them. He suggested you gather abandoned tools from the quarry at the back of Ost Rimmon, which he can melt and forge into shoes.\n3\tReturn to Dringrod\tYou should return to Dringrod with the quarry tools you have gathered, so that he can forge them into horseshoes.\n4\tTalk to Bargwen\tTalk to Bargwen in Ost Rimmon about acquiring a new saddle.\n5\tGather deer hides (total: 6)\tYou should gather deer hides from the deer that can be found by the Firien Wood, in the western Beacon Hills, so that Bargwen can craft a saddle for Sithgar.\n6\tReturn to Bargwen\tBring the deer hides back to Bargwen in Ost Rimmon, so that she can craft a saddle for Sithgar.\n7\tReturn to Sithgar\tYou should go speak with Sithgar now that a saddle and shoes are being provided for his horse.\n",
[10587]="70039989\n1\tFind and return wayward horses to Déorwald (total: 4)\tHorses can be found wandering among the trees and fields to the south of Middlemead. Déorwald has asked for your aid in recovering his stock. You should find his wayward horses and ride them back to his tent in Middlemead.\n2\tTalk to Déorwald\tDéorwald can be found in Middlemead at the traders' pavillion. You have returned many of Déorwald's wayward horses to his keeping. You should now speak to him.\n",
[10588]="7001B1D2\n1\tDeliver the note you received to Saeradan\tSaeradan's cabin is found north along the Greenway between Bree and the North Downs. You will find his cabin in a small copse of trees abutting a steep hill east of Thornley's Farm. You should go at once to Saeradan and learn what aid you may be to him.\n",
[10589]="70060968\n1\tDefeat many creatures of the Angle and clear a path to Gaerond (total: 16)\tMany are the dangerous beasts that remain between the Dunlending refugees and the safety of Gaerond, on the northern border of the Angle of Mitheithel. You have agreed to try and clear a path so they can reach the camp-site in safety.\n2\tTalk to Elladan at Gaerond\tElladan remains at the camp-site of Gaerond, in the Angle.\n3\tTalk to Rúdhan at Gaerond\030Talk to Onora at Gaerond\tRúdhan and Onora have made it safely to Gaerond, but the future unfolds before them with all its mystery and its danger.\n",
[10590]="70071B38\n1\tDefeat kergrim at the Arch of Adazâr (total: 8)\tYou should defeat kergrim at the Arch of Adazâr in western An Shêru. Doing so would make travelling the road that passes beneath the arch more safe for all.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many kergrim at the Arch of Adazâr in western An Shêru, making travelling the road that passes beneath the arch safer for all.\n",
[10591]="70017582\n1\tSummon and defeat the Mad Captain\tThe Mad Captain dwells within the Dark Delvings, south-east from the Shadowed Refuge in the Foundations of Stone. Sadreda instructed you to use the crude charm he gave you to summon and defeat the Mad Captain.\n2\tTalk to Sadreda at the Shadowed Refuge\tSadreda is at the Shadowed Refuge in the Foundations of Stone, north-west from the Dark Delvings. You should return to Sadreda with news of your victory.\n",
[10592]="70069DF0\n1\tLook for threats along the road\tFollow the road east toward Tham Lumren, to the sometimes dangerous road crossing described by Ivoreth while watching for threats that may hinder their travel.\n2\tContinue your search further east, to Tham Lumren\tContinue further east down the road to Tham Lumren, watching for threats that may hinder the travel of Ivoreth and Barhador.\n3\tTalk to Glorfindel\tYou have spotted the Elf-lord Glorfindel near the bridge to Tham Lumren, and he is hailing you. You should talk to Glorfindel.\n4\tReturn to Ivoreth at her camp\tReturn to Ivoreth at her camp in the Angle of Mitheithel and let her know that the road ahead is clear.\n",
})
